{"5129980":{"success":true,"data":{"type":"game","name":"Heirs of the Fountains","steam_appid":5129980,"required_age":0,"is_free":false,"controller_support":"full","detailed_description":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/cebf609af1666a35a2c4afbda32fdb8f.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Explore the Kingdom of Elarion\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/56155e738dda30186c397a00c9606d86.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/56155e738dda30186c397a00c9606d86.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/56155e738dda30186c397a00c9606d86.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch Morwenna has plunged the kingdom into chaos and kidnapped Lady Julia. Two siblings with extraordinary powers must embark on a dangerous journey to rescue her and restore peace to Elarion.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/22aaefb13a67844563500edbe7620fdc.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Overcome the Dangers\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/6b84717aad572e90b5996f93c88e4f7f.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/6b84717aad572e90b5996f93c88e4f7f.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/6b84717aad572e90b5996f93c88e4f7f.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and use your dash. Each level will test your reflexes and skills as you overcome traps, platforms, and hazards while facing the creatures that have invaded the kingdom.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/19a676066d2f787c0e55fdd85e89c487.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Discover Hidden Secrets\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/b6a6d0c34fd9936ef73282110d53e0b5.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/b6a6d0c34fd9936ef73282110d53e0b5.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/b6a6d0c34fd9936ef73282110d53e0b5.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is filled with hidden items and secrets that can only be found by carefully exploring each level. Venture off the main route, investigate hidden corners, and uncover everything the kingdom of Elarion has to offer.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/9af1f771cb97067d2e8f21c87a220673.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Fight Terrible Creatures\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/24244cc0b8f818558b30efe2bd9524c0.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/24244cc0b8f818558b30efe2bd9524c0.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/24244cc0b8f818558b30efe2bd9524c0.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orcs, skeletons, bats, spiders, and other creatures will try to stop you. Fight your way through them in action-platforming battles inspired by the great classics of the genre.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/468b9df2ebc9cd11e679725fec7d35bb.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Face Fearsome Guardians\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/3c40c1418959a979535f6eff1360d690.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/3c40c1418959a979535f6eff1360d690.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/3c40c1418959a979535f6eff1360d690.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the adventure, unique and challenging enemies await you. Study their movements, dodge their attacks, and find the right moment to use your abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a pixel-art action-platforming adventure, discover the fate of the kingdom of Elarion, and help the heirs of House Fountains rescue Lady Julia.<\/p>","about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/cebf609af1666a35a2c4afbda32fdb8f.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Explore the Kingdom of Elarion\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/56155e738dda30186c397a00c9606d86.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/56155e738dda30186c397a00c9606d86.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/56155e738dda30186c397a00c9606d86.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The witch Morwenna has plunged the kingdom into chaos and kidnapped Lady Julia. Two siblings with extraordinary powers must embark on a dangerous journey to rescue her and restore peace to Elarion.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/22aaefb13a67844563500edbe7620fdc.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Overcome the Dangers\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/6b84717aad572e90b5996f93c88e4f7f.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=278 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/6b84717aad572e90b5996f93c88e4f7f.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/6b84717aad572e90b5996f93c88e4f7f.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Run, jump, and use your dash. Each level will test your reflexes and skills as you overcome traps, platforms, and hazards while facing the creatures that have invaded the kingdom.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/19a676066d2f787c0e55fdd85e89c487.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Discover Hidden Secrets\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/b6a6d0c34fd9936ef73282110d53e0b5.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/b6a6d0c34fd9936ef73282110d53e0b5.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/b6a6d0c34fd9936ef73282110d53e0b5.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The path is filled with hidden items and secrets that can only be found by carefully exploring each level. Venture off the main route, investigate hidden corners, and uncover everything the kingdom of Elarion has to offer.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/9af1f771cb97067d2e8f21c87a220673.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Fight Terrible Creatures\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/24244cc0b8f818558b30efe2bd9524c0.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/24244cc0b8f818558b30efe2bd9524c0.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/24244cc0b8f818558b30efe2bd9524c0.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Orcs, skeletons, bats, spiders, and other creatures will try to stop you. Fight your way through them in action-platforming battles inspired by the great classics of the genre.<\/p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" style=\"text-align: center\"><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><img class=\"bb_img\" src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/468b9df2ebc9cd11e679725fec7d35bb.avif?t=1793695400\" alt=\"Face Fearsome Guardians\" width=620 height=72 \/><\/span><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/3c40c1418959a979535f6eff1360d690.poster.avif?t=1793695400\" aria-hidden=\"true\"width=492 height=276 ><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/3c40c1418959a979535f6eff1360d690.webm?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/extras\/3c40c1418959a979535f6eff1360d690.mp4?t=1793695400\" type=\"video\/mp4\"><\/video><\/span><\/h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Throughout the adventure, unique and challenging enemies await you. Study their movements, dodge their attacks, and find the right moment to use your abilities.<\/p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Embark on a pixel-art action-platforming adventure, discover the fate of the kingdom of Elarion, and help the heirs of House Fountains rescue Lady Julia.<\/p>","short_description":"Heirs of the Fountains is a pixel-art action-platformer starring two siblings with unique powers. Explore the kingdom of Elarion, overcome dangerous levels, defeat fearsome creatures and legendary bosses, and rescue Lady Julia from the clutches of the witch Morwenna.","supported_languages":"English, French, Italian, German, Spanish - Spain, Portuguese - Brazil, Catalan, Japanese, Simplified Chinese, Russian","header_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/fbf934d6e97a81413b6171b2dba8662381420c9c\/header.jpg?t=1793695400","capsule_image":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/662cb73cd46070552507c90307bd3ed774ea4459\/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1793695400","capsule_imagev5":"https:\/\/shared.akamai.steamstatic.com\/store_item_assets\/steam\/apps\/5129980\/662cb73cd46070552507c90307bd3ed774ea4459\/capsule_184x69.jpg?t=1793695400","website":null,"pc_requirements":{"minimum":"<strong>Minimum:<\/strong><br><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li>Requires a 64-bit processor and operating system<br><\/